'' NO LLVM IS SAID BEFORE THE FRONT END RUNS (TKO0124), not only after it: a build without
'' clang used to parse and lower the whole program and only then stop at TKO0111. The
'' warning names no path -- TKO0111 still does, and '--version' names the clang found.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_CLANG=tests/driver/src/no-such-clang.exe
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -o tests/driver/src/no-llvm-warning-out.exe tests/source/plain.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 3
'' EXPECT-OUT-SEQ: warning TKO0124: LLVM is not installed
'' EXPECT-OUT-SEQ: error TKO0111: no usable toolchain
